OL,3,GNorth West
OL,4,
OL,5,CToday:FA chilly start in some rural
OL,6,Fspots. Patchy cloud and spells of
OL,7,Fsunshine today with a small chance of
OL,8,Fthe odd shower, more especially during
OL,9,Fthe morning. Feeling pleasantly warm
OL,10,Fin the sunshine, and with lighter
OL,11,Fwinds than yesterday.
OL,12,
OL,13,CTonight:FClear spells developing for a
OL,14,Ftime tonight, before clouding over
OL,15,Fwith some showery outbreaks of rain
OL,16,Farriving later on. Heavy bursts of
OL,17,Frain are possible by the morning.
OL,23,QppppppppppppppppppppGSource: Met Office
OL,24,ANext Page  BWeather  CReg News  FReg TV
