OL,2,W+.-'"-$/*%*%*%/"-$/*%Q,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,
OL,3,GNorth West
OL,4,
OL,5,CSunday:FShowery rain will move through
OL,6,Fduring the morning, locally on the
OL,7,Fheavy side. This will be followed by a
OL,8,Flargely dry and at times brighter
OL,9,Fafternoon. Breezy, though feeling warm.
OL,10,
OL,11,COutlook for Monday to Wednesday:
OL,12,FUnsettled at first with spells of
OL,13,Fheavy rain at times and strong winds.
OL,14,FSettling down on Wednesday with spells
OL,15,Fof sunshine, and temperatures around
OL,16,Fthe seasonal average.
OL,23,QppppppppppppppppppppGSource: Met Office
